  "safety_privacy_statement": "MEDAI-V2-DATA-INFRA-SPEC-01 is a reports-only data-infra spec. It adds three public-safe reports, one reports-only audit script, and one focused pytest module. No DB schema change, no migration, no runtime DB row read, no persistence code change, no app/main.py / launcher / startup preflight / config / Streamlit-wiring / V2 contract module modification. No license text was reproduced. No licensed terminology rows were read. No private license-acknowledgement file contents were read. No private config contents were read. No terminology_data/, data/terminology/, runtime DB, or source document contents were opened. No private filesystem paths were printed. No raw text, raw OCR text, raw document text, raw filenames, PHI, keys, or secrets appear in any committed file. No external API was called or enabled. No tags created, moved, or deleted. PARK-20..26 tag pairs, the FREEZE tag pair, the term helper/wiring PARK-01 tag pair, and the license-gate PARK-02 tag pair all remain intact. Private adapter implementation and real private-store access remain explicitly BLOCKED. Cue expansion remains explicitly NOT recommended.",

